Well I've finally got around to doing it!
I now can claim to have produced some patches for Slash'em!

See my 'new' Patch page at
http://www.geocities.com/xenothemorph2001/

The First patch adds a new comestable - Sprigs of Mistletoe
They have some unusual properties, and are the first part of my work in
progress the Druid patch.

The Second patch is a little more complex - Raise Mummy
It adds a new technique for necromancers called 'Raise Mummy'.
With this they can take a suitable corpse and raise it up to become a
mummy, like the 'Raise Zombies' technique they start with.
In this case only one corpse can be reanimated & they use up a mummy
wrapping doing this, though sometimes the mummy ends up wearing it.
Unpaid mummy wrappings seem to be handled as well as can be expected.

Please check these out even if they don't really grab your attention,
they are my first attempts and I would like feedback, esp since my
C/C++ skills are quite rusty!

